Factor a brand of HelloFresh is seeking a Field Learning Operations Manager. As the Field Learning Operations Manager and a member of the leadership team in one of our Fulfillment Centers, your role will be to manage the learning needs of all employees in the building. Your role will support the creation and delivery of products that improve the overall onboarding and the on-the-job learning experience. You will be the site POC for Field Learning and a key player in building internal and external relationships between operations and Field Learning.&nbsp;

You will…

• Promote food safety, quality, and a safety-first culture&nbsp;

• Work with the salaried and hourly trainers to identify and remove operational and training barriers

• Build and manage data analysis methods to track key performance metrics

• Liaise between hourly groups, salaried groups, and technical stakeholders to identify potential bottlenecks/roadblocks for technical process launches and updates throughout the network.

• Develop and track team development plans and initiatives&nbsp;

• Work cohesively with ancillary departments and operations teams to build and deliver technical and soft skills training onsite&nbsp;

• Manage Distribution/fulfillment interdepartmental relationships (Ops, Safety, FS&amp;Q, HR, etc.)

• Review Distribution/fulfillment level reporting and disseminate to key Distribution/fulfillment stakeholders

• Oversee, design or consult on training initiatives that impact both local and network business&nbsp;

• &nbsp;Project manage deliverables which includes scheduling, executing and providing real time updates to senior leadership&nbsp;

• Review certified job training records for compliance and escalate gaps or opportunities for improvement

• Understand parameters of machine operations training including but not limited to forklift and powered equipment operations, kitchen and fulfillment hardware&nbsp;&nbsp;

• Create a positive team dynamic that encourages associates to ask questions, provide feedback, adapt to the ever-changing business and stay focused on the customer experience

