• Customer-focused: You are obsessed with delivering a positive customer experience and you strive to deliver a product that is second to none

• Organized: you are able to manage multiple tasks and provide updates to key stakeholders

• Flexible: you are able to work various shifts when training needs to be delivered including evenings and weekends

• Technical: you are able to build, manage, and navigate data through Google and Microsoft suites&nbsp;

